      "writtenOn": "2026-11-27T07:53:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: when the Name read failed with a transient error, the Polarity read is\nstill attempted. During an Entity-Manager stall each call can wait the 25 s\nD-Bus timeout, so each iteration may take about twice as long. Could the\nPolarity read be skipped when Name is neither a value nor absent?",
      "revId": "8e1ef319d2147357c7b6b1b368362c73311877ab",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
